/v1/","context":{"app_id":4751190,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4751190-1846651706692131","game_id":"steam-4751190","kind":"announcement","title":"DEGENERATE STAR is in October Next Fest!","summary":"Next Fest has begun! I'm very (nervously) excited for so many people to try the demo and hopefully wishlist the full game ;)Steam Scream and AdventureX come straight after, so it should be a busy couple of weeks in the lead-up to release. If you're a content creator or journalist and would like early access to the full game, please get in contact with me at ozoneinteract(at)gmail(dot)com. As always, I hope you enjoy the game and very much look forward to showing you what is in store. The S.S Van","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:22:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4751190-1843481262705665","game_id":"steam-4751190","kind":"announcement","title":"DEGENERATE STAR joins the Haunted Publishing Syndicate!","summary":"Hey!I am extremely happy to say that DEGENERATE STAR has found publishing support with the Haunted Publishing Syndicate. They've started very recently but have already helped with 4 wonderful titles (go check 'em out!) and I'm super grateful to be working with them.As you can also see, the official release date (pending world ending catastrophe) is November 6th! I can't wait to show you what I've been working on :)Thanks,Ozone Interactive","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T21:01:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4751190-1837955055365147","game_id":"steam-4751190","kind":"announcement","title":"DEGENERATE STAR is at Brilliant Indie Treasures!","summary":"I'm very happy to say that DEGENERATE STAR has been featured in the official Brilliant Indie Treasures showcase at Develop Brighton. Come over on the 15th of July (aka tomorrow, I may have forgotten to make this post) and you can be the first people to try the demo. I also have some VLSA stickers to give away, and perhaps even some codes for the prerelease of the game... I'd love to see people there, and I'm looking forward to trying all the other incredible games showcased as well! If you can't","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T05:02:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055365147","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4751190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4751190":"2026-10-26T04:02:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4751190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4829350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4751190","app_id":4751190,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"4e62de5b